# May (TRAINER_MAY_LILYCOVE_MUDKIP, src/data/trainer_parties.h sParty_MayLilycoveMudkip: TROPIUS 31, SLUGMA 32,
# PELIPPER 32, GROVYLE 34) has two Grass types that resist all the chained Swampert's Water and Ground moves:
# TM14 Blizzard (LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_4F/scripts.inc: the 4F TM clerk) over Cut, which the Lilycove Move
# Deleter forgets, and a Linoone from the routes' grass to carry Cut from here on (walk_to hm = true).
